window.products.push({"id":297126,"name":"MULTI-SPARKING Icicle Lights 29.4Ft 320LED Outdoor Christmas Icicle String Lights with 60 Drops 8 Modes White Wire LED String Light Indoor Decor for W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PzcDE+zoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High-End Icicle Lights Specification & Connectable】: The christmas icicle string lights includes 320-count quality mini clear led lights, total length is 39.2ft with 60 drops, lights length is 29.4ft and each led is 0.33ft apart, 9.84ft lead wire, distance between drops is 0.49ft, 0.49ft end connector. You can connect extra 3 set for larger decorating projects. Simple tangles for icicle lights, easy to unfasten and hang. 【Premium & Waterproof & Safe】: Certified by ETL, low voltage christmas curtain lights string, can keep at a low temperature state after lighting up for hours, ensure using security. The lights string is made of great material and superb craftsmanship, LED waterproof grade is IP44, great for indoor and outdoor lighting decoration. 【8 Modes & Timer Function & Brightness Adjustment】: Multi-sparking LED string light has 8 lighting modes for you to choose. Just press the button on the transformer to change the lighting mode according to the different requirements.Press the button and hold for 3 seconds until the green light on, then the timer function start, light string will be on for 6 hours, off for 18 hours, and continue to maintain this mode. The brightness adjustment function can be adjusted with the remote control. 【Multifunctional Remote Controller】: Come with a multifunction remote to control the Power On/Off, 8 Lighting Modes and set Timer, Brightness Adjustment. This icicle lights also has a memory function for your next convenient use. Compared with the transformer button, using the remote control will be more convenient and will not be limited by the location. (Tips: remote without battery, please prepare a CR2025 battery) 【Indoor & Outdoor Wide Application】: Classic mini string lights is a perfect romantic atmosphere creator. Perfect for decorating the eaves of your house at Christmas, It is also suitable for decorating curtains, walls, bedrooms, market, shopping mall and widely used as decoration for Christmas, Halloween, St Patricks Day, Parties and other celebration occasions. Please do not hesitate to contact us if you have any questions!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PzcDE+zoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MULTI-SPARKING","source_asin":"B09YTSWHYC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-297126","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YTSWHYC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YTSWHYC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
