window.products.push({"id":297239,"name":"100pcs Reed Diffuser Sticks 21cm*3mm Natural Rattan Wood Aromatherapy Replacements Stick for Home Scent Fragrance Air Fresher Aroma Oil","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NA9DoO+cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✿【SPECIFICATIONS】Reed diffuser replacement sticks are 21CM in length and 3mm in diameter which is the ideal and standard size to apply with diffuser. Each box comes with 100PCS diffuser sticks in natural wood color. ✿【PREMIUM MATERIAL 】 Our reeds diffuser sticks are made of high quality rattan, which is porous and lightweight with processed with mildew proofing and drying treatment, so they will not get mouldy. ✿【HOW TO USE】 Prepare a diffuser bottle and rattan wood sticks. Pour your favorite essential oils (aroma oils ) into the bottle. Dipping one or more diffusers stick into aromatic oils or perfumes to wet, the fragrance of the essential oil will volatilize through these porous diffusers. ✿【WIDELY USED】It takes 2 or 3 days for the reed sticks to soak in the scent. When the fragrance weakens, simply turn the reed sticks upside down to refresh air in living room, bedroom, kitchen, bathroom, , office, wedding, storage room, wardrobe, etc. ✿【GUARANTEE】Please check the product information before ordering.And please check the package when you receive it. Please feel free to contact us if you have any issues.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NA9DoO+cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aeeteek","source_asin":"B0BG6TVNVF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-297239","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG6TVNVF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG6TVNVF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
