window.products.push({"id":297348,"name":"Americana EPB399C by Elite Glass Mason Jar Blender with 17oz Jar + 20oz. Sports Bottle, Blend Personal Smoothie, Crush Ice, Shakes, Keto Protein, 300 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pyubw7DAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy your favorite shakes, fruit smoothies, or power packed protein drinks with the Americana Collection by Maxi-Matic Retro Personal Blender. Comes with one 16 oz glass mason jar & lid and a 20 oz sports bottle with drinking lid so you can enjoy your tasty creations on the go. The blender has a powerful 300 W motor and is easy to store. The handy pulse lever makes it easy to start and stop the machine. The power indicator illuminates when the blender is ready to use and the operating light lets you know the machine’s in operation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pyubw7DAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Americana","source_asin":"B08LQ5HQ84","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-297348","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LQ5HQ84","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LQ5HQ84","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":297349,"name":"Nourison Aubusson Floral Grey 5'3\" x 7'3\" Area -Rug, Easy -Cleaning, Non Shedding, Bed Room, Living Room, Dining Room, Kitchen (5x7)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":107.74,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+eB4oIeIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Taking cues from Renaissance-era splendor, the Aubusson Collection evokes a spirit of understated luxury. Intricate patterns in classic colorways make each Aubusson area rug an elegant complement to French country, shabby chic, and traditional styles of home decor. Expertly machine made of soft yet durable polypropylene fibers for the modern lifestyle. Art for your floors, this traditional area rug from the Aubusson Collection makes a distinguished statement. A subtly hued floral medallion and border design on a soft grey ground pays homage to the elegant craftsmanship of classic French decor. Machine made of soft yet durable polypropylene for modern living, this opulent area rug is ideal in traditional, French country, and shabby chic settings.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+eB4oIeIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nourison","source_asin":"B08PPPDLGZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-297349","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PPPDLGZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PPPDLGZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":297350,"name":"KAHLA Five Senses Dining Plate 10-3/4 Inches, White Color, 1 Piece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41c-f0wwZTL._AC_SL1350_.jpg","description":"The FIVE SENSES plates delight with their functional design. The FIVE SENSES dinner plate is cut on a slant. This provides an easier access to the food from the lower side and the higher back side prevents spills and crumbs on the table. A table laid out with these plates appears alive and dynamic thanks to the slanted plate rims. Do you love to lend a hand in the kitchen – even if there is not time for a grand meal every day? FIVE SENSES is porcelain for people who enjoy cooking and eating with all their senses. Many clever details surprise with ingenuity or put a smile on your face. The cups are slightly shifted off-centre on the saucers to allow more space for spoons, sugar cubes and chocolate biscuits. The spoon fits under the lid of the sugar bowl – we call it Sugar loaf. The cut of the plates is slanted – this prevents spills and crumbs on the table but also allows an easier access for knife, fork and spoon. There are beautiful bowls in all proportions and sizes imaginable and baking tins for delicious dishes from the oven. Whether on wood, stainless steel or glass: in brilliant white, FIVE SENSES is the ideal partner for every well-stocked kitchen and on every table of food lovers. FIVE SENSES was awarded eight international design awards. Kahla porcelain is dishwasher safe, microwave safe and ovenproof. We hope you enjoy our products made in Germany using environmentally and socially sustainable production practices.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41c-f0wwZTL._AC_SL1350_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KAHLA - PORCELAIN FOR THE SENSES","source_asin":"B003AMMYXG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-297350","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003AMMYXG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003AMMYXG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
