window.products.push({"id":297481,"name":"Electric Air Pump for Inflatable, 4000mAh Portable Rechargeable Tiny Air Mattress Pump, Battery Powered Quick Inflator Deflator with 4 Nozzles, for Sw","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51k8QrcflgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Quick Inflation/Deflation & High Pressure】: Designed with 4 kPa high air pressure, our wireless air pump can inflate/deflate items in 450M/L flow rate. You can easily inflate outdoor air bed mattresses, swimming rings, water floating row and other inflatable products within minutes. The air pump for inflatables can fill 38 swimming rings, 15 air mattresses, or 16 inflatable boats at a time or deflate 35+ storage bags after a full charge. Perfect for any outdoor & indoor occasions. 【USB Rechargeable & Long Lasting 4000mAh Battery】: Built in 4000mAh rechargeable lithium battery, our electric air pump for inflatable pool works up to 50 minutes after full charged. Including a type-c charging cable, the small air pump can be quickly recharged by power bank, laptop, car USB port for outdoors or charged by power adapter at home. Clear charging indication: green for finished, and red for 0-99% status. Note: the tiny air pump can't be used while charged. 【4 Detachable Nozzles & Wide Applicability】: Equipped with 4 different air nozzles, our tiny air pump allows you to inflate/deflate most of the inflatable air products, such as air sleeping pads, inflatable beds, air mattresses, air toys, swimming rings, pool floats, pool rafts, vacuum storage bags, etc. Install the suitable nozzle on the port, then press and hold for 2 seconds to start. 【Small & Portable & Durable】: This quick fill cordless electric air pump just weights 6.3oz with product size 2.2 * 2.2 * 3.2 inches, which can be easily carried in your backpack, pocket or luggage. Made of solid ABS material and great sealing technology, this rechargeable air pump is sturdy, well-sealed and durable. Getting rid of tangled wires makes it as a great convience for enjoying outdoor camping, hiking, beach, or indoor storage. 【Package & Friendly Customer Service】: You will get 1* electric air pump, 4 * nozzles, 1* USB charger, 1* user manual. 100% Satisfaction guarantee! 60 days of free return and lifetime after-sales guarantee. Please feel free to contact us if you have any question during your purchase. We will give you a satisfactory answer within 24h. Your satisfition is our motivation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51k8QrcflgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alinkey","source_asin":"B09RGSFJY1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-297481","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09RGSFJY1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09RGSFJY1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
