window.products.push({"id":297590,"name":"Isaac Jacobs 3-Pack Large Clear Storage Bins with Handles, Plastic Organizer for Home, Room, Office, Fridge, Kitchen/Pantry Non-Slip Container Set, Fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zuNV0fU-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"MINIMAL DESIGN: These Isaac Jacobs clear storage bins with cutout handles are the best way to create a custom home organization system. The clear storage bin set is made of high-quality plastic with a sleek design to match all styles of homes, rooms, and offices. Use the non-slip storage containers in the kitchen, pantry, fridge, closet, bedroom, and bathroom to maximize space. Store everything from snacks to socks! They’re leak-proof and easy to clean with soap and water. NOT DISHWASHER SAFE. CLEAR ORGANIZATION: Staying organized is easy with these non-slip large plastic storage bins. Buh-bye cluttered fridge, messy closet, and essentials that need to be tamed with a storage solution. These 3 matching bins are durable and hold everyday items in one spot, from produce and canned goods to books and toys. Each clear container makes it easy to see what’s inside, while the built-in handles and open top allow for quick access. Dimensions of each bin: 11.2” L x 8” W x 6” H, 1.1 lbs. NOT YOUR AVERAGE BIN: You’ll experience the difference in quality when you feel our modern bins. Each high-quality container has comfortable angled edges and is lightweight yet sturdy. The cutout handles make it easy to hold and carry, while the non-slip bottom helps keep the bin in place. Store your coolest items - from frozen veggies to your favorite shoes or heels (remember - double check your bin size first). The see-through bins are portable and can be stacked when not in use to save space. EASY STORAGE: These portable clear storage containers are food / freezer safe and conveniently sized to fit throughout the house. Store anything from produce to drinks and dry goods. Unlike regular fridge drawers, you can use these multi-functional clear view bins in the refrigerator and take them out, or use them in other ways. Isaac Jacobs also makes other clear storage bin sizes to organize your home’s many spaces. You’ll want a clear bin set for every room! For crafts, toys, and more. MULTI-USE: Use this BPA free organizer set for your entire home. Imagine being able to organize your kitchen with space-saving refrigerator bins - store different types of foods, drinks, fruits, and veggies in the fridge, and arrange snacks, cans, and meal prep in the pantry. Declutter the whole house, including your closet. Group socks in the bedroom, cleaning supplies in the laundry room, arts and crafts in the playroom, and hair and beauty supplies in separate clear bins in the bathroom.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zuNV0fU-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Isaac Jacobs International","source_asin":"B08W2JJ4QL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-297590","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08W2JJ4QL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08W2JJ4QL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
