window.products.push({"id":297603,"name":"Best Choice Products Large 1500W Heat Adjustable Electric Wall Mount & Free Standing Fireplace Heater with Glass XL","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81B1Ck+UL9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Best Choice Products presents this brand new electric fireplace. Our fireplace is energy efficient, no emissions, no pollution with dual heat settings 750W & 1500W (Low & High). This 2 in 1 fireplace comes with a wall-mounted design and free standing design for your preference. It also comes with a remote control making it easy to turn on and off, with an elegant glass front, and can be used in your living room, family room, bedroom or office. We purchase our products directly from the manufacturer, so you know you‘re getting the best prices available. NEW PRODUCT WITH FACTORY PACKAGING. FEATURES: 2 in 1 fireplace: wall-mounted & Free standing with stunning tempered glass panel heater. Certifications: CUL/CE/GS/ROHS. Energy efficient, NO emissions, NO pollution. Steel construction in glossy black finish with stunning tempered glass panel heater. Dual heat settings 750W & 1500W (Low & High). On/Off switch. 3D flame technology. Full function remote control. Detachable elegant black glass front. Thermal cut-out. Includes mounting bracket/hardware and stand. User's Manual. WARNING: Glass may become hot during use, please keep children away from item. SPECIFICATION: Overall Dimensions (Wall-mounted Design): 35\"(L) x 6\"(W) x 22\"(H). Overall Dimensions (Free Standing Design): 35\"(L) x 6\"(W) x 24.5\"(H). Product Weight: 30lbs. 60Hz. 110-120V. PLEASE NOTE: Our digital images are as accurate as possible. However, different monitors may cause colors to vary slightly. Some of our items are handcrafted and/or hand finished. Color can vary and slight imperfections in the metal work are normal and considered evidence of the hand-finishing process, which adds character and authenticity to those items.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81B1Ck+UL9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Best Choice Products","source_asin":"B00G5KP02C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-297603","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00G5KP02C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00G5KP02C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
