window.products.push({"id":297615,"name":"SEEPER Ice Packs for Coolers, Materials Eco-Friendly, Reusable Long Lasting Freezer Packs for Lunch Bags/Boxes, Air Cooler, Food Preservation, Medical","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mpb01VMgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Food preservation & Easy to carry】 When you're going camping, are you still worried about the preservation of food? The SEEPER Ice Packs that can cool you for a long time can help you! With a slim body and dimensions of 1.57*1.57*6.5 inches, the Ice Packs do not take up much space and are lightweight and easy to carry. The ice pack is easy to use, just pack the food and the ice pack together to extend the edible time of the food!What are you still hesitating for? 【Eco-friendly material & Reusable】 SEEPER ice pack should be a good thing! One pack consists of 4 non-toxic, BPA-free plastic ice packs. Compared with traditional disposable ice packs, this ice pack has a hard shell and environmentally friendly materials that can be used many times over. Built-in soluble ice crystal gel particles, effectively shorten the freezing time. In order to avoid freezing your hands, it is recommended to wrap the ice pack with a towel from the freezer before use. 【The magic tool to cool down in summer 】 Don't let the heat and dryness take over your summer anymore! SEEPER ice pack and air cooler together will bring you a refreshing summer! The air cooler uses the natural properties of water to cool the air, and when you add a frozen ice pack, you can get twice as cool as if you were back in winter! Note: When you add water to the ice bag, do not exceed the maximum water level line, otherwise the ice box may break due to freezing. 【Screw cap closure】 We all know that when the ice pack leaves the refrigerator, the water inside the ice pack will slowly melt into liquid due to the increase in ambient temperature. SEEPER ice pack bottle mouth with screw cap closure, using the principle of increasing friction, can save the effort to screw the cap. So as long as the cap is tightened, even on the bumpiest of roads, the screw cap can ensure that it is sealed tightly. No water spills and food contamination disasters! 【Multi-function】 Multifunctional ice pack makes your life more convenient! Long strip design for lunch bags , lunch boxes , coolers , grocery bags. Whether it's for a kid's lunch or delivering fruit to a friend from afar, SEEPER Ice Packs can help! If an accidental sprain occurs, ice packs can also be first aid and reduce pain. When the ice pack is idle, you can put it inside the refrigerator. Because of its versatility, maybe the next second you will want to use a frozen good ice bag.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mpb01VMgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEEPER","source_asin":"B09MN9FHV5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-297615","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MN9FHV5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MN9FHV5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
