window.products.push({"id":297886,"name":"Personalized Family Ornament 2022 - Christmas Family of 5 Ornament 2022 - Reindeer Christmas Ornaments Family of 5 Reindeer Family Christmas Tree Orna","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61v0mHG-AzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Christmas traditions make Christmas memorable. We carry high-quality and adorable customized family ornament 2022 family of 5. Think about what you loved about Christmas as a child and start a few traditions this year with your loved ones! Personalized ornaments for Christmas trees are a thoughtful gift idea. If you want to impress that special someone, personalize their gift! The saying ‘it’s the thought that counts’ certainly applies when it comes to gift-giving. Ornaments by Elves is the most trusted, highly-rated family of 5 Christmas ornament seller — Our talented artists hand-write each personalization for free to match your exact request, using dry-safe custom paint German pens. Ornaments by Elves will process your order the same day of your purchase. You’ll receive your name ornaments family delivered straight to your door and ready to hang in just a few days. Many people judge the value of a gift not by how much it’s worth, but how it’s presented by the gifter. That is why every order will come with an environmentally friendly special gift box to gift to that special loved one!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61v0mHG-AzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ornaments by Elves","source_asin":"B07CSHW8H8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-297886","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CSHW8H8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CSHW8H8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":297887,"name":"BlueHills 3 Piece Luxury Silk Gift Set 100% Pure Mulberry Natural Soft Silk Pillowcase 2 Pack for Hair and Skin Hidden Zipper & Pure Silk Eye Mask in ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818d4td6m1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PURE SILK LUXURY GIFT SET IN AN ELEGANT GIFT BOX – This beautifully packed gift set contains two pure silk pillowcases, one pure silk eye mask set elegantly wrapped in gold tissue and packaged in a luxurious, gift box. This set is a perfect gift for you to give your loved ones on holidays such as Christmas, Valentine’s Day, Birthdays, or Anniversaries. TWO PACK PURE SILK PILLOWCASES WITH HIDDEN ZIPPER: This pack includes two 600 thread count, silk on both sides 19 Momme silk pillowcases with a hidden zipper closing mechanism. This design allows the silk pillowcase to be held overnight without moving around. A large opening mechanism and long zipper allow you to fit the pillow into the silk pillowcase easily. PURE NATURAL SILK SMOOTH SOFT EYE MASK - BLINDFOLD: This gift pack also contains a pure silk eye mask with biocular silk covering. This grey luxurious eye mask with eye lashes design also has an adjustable strap. The included easy-to-adjust headband won’t tangle your hair or snag your pillow. Additionally, the adjuster stays at the back of the head instead of the temples to improve comfort for side sleepers. This mask also works well in conjunction with ear plugs BEAUTY SLEEP WITH ULTRA SOFT, SMOOTH SILK: the silk’s natural fiber and tight weave allow the skin and hair to slide over the pillowcase freely and gently, reducing facial wrinkles, and preventing dry and knotted hair, and reducing hair loss. Silk pillowcases never conduct static electricity. The Pure Silk Eye Mask is a bonus gift. GREAT FOR HAIR AND SKIN – BlueHills’ mulberry silk is great for hair and skin. This product is a great gift for anyone who enjoys deep, restorative sleep!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818d4td6m1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BlueHills","source_asin":"B07KWFKW94","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-297887","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KWFKW94","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KWFKW94","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
