window.products.push({"id":297947,"name":"Culina Bamboo Cooking Utensils","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41vwQapFe7L._AC_.jpg","description":"Looking to equip your kitchen with cooking utensils that promote nature awareness, great craftsmanship and superior performance? Rejoice! Culina Wooden Cooking Utensils have it all in store for you! A set of 6 cooking essentials to strike the right balance between sustainability, convenience and efficiency. Bamboo's excellence from nature to your kitchen Culina Bamboo Wooden Cooking Utensils come as a set in a mesh bag. 1 mixing spoon, 1 rounded fork, 1 slotted spoon, 1 turner spatula, 1 slotted spatula and 1 blending spatula. Made of a renewable resource, they're the ultimate cookware for the environmentally conscious. The bamboo used in the crafting of our ware comes from a natural shoot grown in the forests of China. Bamboo is a grassy wood known to combine strength and flexibility. In their natural habitat, Bamboo shoots withstand high magnitude earthquakes and extreme winds by bending without ever snapping, this incredible feature in the plant's fiber is passed to each of Culina Bamboo Wood Cooking Utensils. Geared to utilitarian use at professional level or at home, the set will outlast the traditional (lumber-made) wooden counterparts. Durability, convenience and efficiency in the kitchen Besides an heirloom feel the set of Culina bamboo utensils provides to your decor, the real beauty remains efficiency and endurance. Culina utensil set is: suited to everything from mixing, stirring, slow-cooking, dipping, scooping, to sautéing, grilling, folding egg whites and more! heatproof and safe even when left to lean against pots. Steam-resistant: utensils do not bend, bubble or snap easily Scratch free: will not damage nonstick cookware. Nice and sturdy to remove fond Heavy duty designed: crafted for utilitarian use by professionals or at home Perfect to get the job done with great satisfaction as it proves consistent over the years.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41vwQapFe7L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Culina","source_asin":"B00FL70D40","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-297947","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FL70D40","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FL70D40","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":297948,"name":"Pavoni Foldable Table - Portable Travel, Floor, Gaming, Couch, Laptop Desk - Collapsible and Adjustable Working, Reading, Writing, or Eating Surface -","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yvIj3yQEL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Are you looking for a versatile table you could use while traveling, working or simply lounging at home? You have always wanted to be able to work comfortably on your laptop while traveling or commuting. Even in transit, you believe it’s best to always maximize your time and aim to stay productive. The only problem you encounter when trying to use your laptop or write on your planner while traveling is the lack of tables. Bringing a portable desk feels like a great idea--when they’re not unstable. You’re looking for a travel-friendly desk that’s unlike all the wobbly disappointments you’ve dealt with in the past. The Pavoni Folding Table lets you comfortably eat, read or work anywhere with ease. Strategically designed with a unique base, this table allows you to work on your laptop or eat comfortably wherever you may be. Flexible and convenient, it can either be placed on a flat surface or in between your legs for added stability. You won’t regret taking this table with you on your next camping trip. Weighing at only 2.4lbs, this collapsible outdoor essential will not be a burden to carry in your trekking backpack. Whether you are planning to take this compact table with you to a picnic or to a group study session in a coffee shop, you will be amazed with its portability. Easily collapsible into three slim parts, this table is a breeze to bring throughout the day. Need more reasons to get this collapsible table? Check out these great features: ✅ Thoughtfully packaged with an instructions manual ✅ Great gift idea for both men and women ✅ Compact size makes it easy to store and carry Work and eat comfortably anywhere. Add the Pavoni Folding Table to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yvIj3yQEL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pavoni","source_asin":"B07X8XZ6XP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-297948","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07X8XZ6XP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07X8XZ6XP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
